---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---
<MainLayout title="Presupuesto universitario | UniMatchCAT" description="Calcula un presupuesto orientativo de gastos para estudiar un grado universitario">
<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-10 space-y-8">
<header class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl"><p class="text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest text-xs font-bold">Herramienta práctica</p><h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white">Calcula tu presupuesto universitario</h1><p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">Introduce tus propios importes para estimar gastos del curso. No usamos precios inventados ni enviamos los datos a un servidor.</p></header><section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-6"><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5" id="budget-inputs"><label class="block text-sm text-slate-300">Matrícula anual (€)<input data-budget="matricula" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0" inputmode="decimal" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 px-3 py-3 text-white focus:outline-amber-400" /></label><label class="block text-sm text-slate-300">Tasas y material anual (€)<input data-budget="tasas" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0" inputmode="decimal" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 px-3 py-3 text-white focus:outline-amber-400" /></label><label class="block text-sm text-slate-300">Transporte mensual (€)<input data-budget="transporte" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0" inputmode="decimal" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 px-3 py-3 text-white focus:outline-amber-400" /></label><label class="block text-sm text-slate-300">Alojamiento mensual (€)<input data-budget="alojamiento" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0" inputmode="decimal" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 px-3 py-3 text-white focus:outline-amber-400" /></label><label class="block text-sm text-slate-300">Comida y otros gastos mensuales (€)<input data-budget="comida" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0" inputmode="decimal" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 px-3 py-3 text-white focus:outline-amber-400" /></label><label class="block text-sm text-slate-300">Meses de gasto durante el curso<input id="budget-months" type="number" min="1" max="12" step="1" value="10" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-lg bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 px-3 py-3 text-white" /></label></div><div class="mt-6 border-t border-slate-800 pt-5 space-y-2"><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Estimación total del curso</p><p id="budget-total" aria-live="polite" class="text-4xl font-black text-amber-400">0,00 €</p><p id="budget-detail" class="text-sm text-slate-400"></p></div></section><p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Cálculo: matrícula + tasas/material + (transporte + alojamiento + comida/otros) × meses. No contempla becas, cambios de precios ni circunstancias personales; confirma costes en las fuentes oficiales.</p><script is:inline>
(()=>{const fields=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-budget]')],months=document.getElementById('budget-months'),fmt=new Intl.NumberFormat('es-ES',{style:'currency',currency:'EUR'});function calc(){const vals=Object.fromEntries(fields.map(e=>[e.dataset.budget,Math.max(0,Number(e.value)||0)]));const m=Math.max(1,Math.min(12,Math.floor(Number(months.value)||10)));const fixed=vals.matricula+vals.tasas,monthly=vals.transporte+vals.alojamiento+vals.comida;document.getElementById('budget-total').textContent=fmt.format(fixed+monthly*m);document.getElementById('budget-detail').textContent=`Gastos fijos: ${fmt.format(fixed)} · Mensuales: ${fmt.format(monthly)} × ${m} meses`;}fields.concat(months).forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('input',calc));calc()})();
</script>
</div>
</MainLayout>
